      "start": 542.52,
      "end": 551.4
    },
    {
      "en": "And in understanding more about the benefits that trees and woodlands bring to our society.",
      "asr_range": [
        1008,
        1023
      ],
      "start": 552.11,
      "end": 558.51
    },
    {
      "en": "Mr. Brown further outlined the reasons for the recently launched environmental project.",
      "asr_range": [
        1023,
        1035
      ],
      "start": 558.75,
      "end": 564.03
    },
    {
      "en": "He said, \"Our city wants to be a world-class region.\"",
      "asr_range": [
        1035,
        1045
      ],
      "start": 564.27,
      "end": 567.95
    },
    {
      "en": "We have a lot of fantastic economic development going on, but the natural environment needs to keep up with that.",
      "asr_range": [
        1045,
        1065
      ],
      "start": 568.19,
      "end": 574.99
    },
    {
      "en": "He believes the project will reconnect people with trees and the natural world.",
      "asr_range": [
        1065,
        1078
      ],
      "start": 575.23,
      "end": 579.87
    },
    {
      "en": "Provide benefits to health and reduce stress.",
      "asr_range": [
        1078,
        1085
      ],
      "start": 580.11,
      "end": 583.15
    },
    {
      "en": "He said, \"Woodlands can do great things in terms of air pollution reduction and can help to protect against noise pollution.\"",
      "asr_range": [
        1085,
        1106
      ],
      "start": 583.39,
      "end": 591.23
    },
    {
      "en": "They can also help cities and towns reduce the urban heat island effect and flooding.",
      "asr_range": [
        1106,
        1121
      ],
      "start": 591.47,
      "end": 597.15
    },
    {
      "en": "Now listen again.",
      "asr_range": [
        1121,
        1124
      ],
      "start": 598.51,
      "end": 600.19
    },
    {
      "en": "A city in England has started an ambitious plan to plant as many as one million trees every year for the next decade.",
      "asr_range": [
        1124,
        1147
      ],
      "start": 601.07,
      "end": 609.79
    },
    {
      "en": "The project is called the City of Trees.",
      "asr_range": [
        1147,
        1155
      ],
      "start": 610.03,
      "end": 613.63
    },
    {
      "en": "Project director Tony Brown explained that the green venture has three main aims.",
      "asr_range": [
        1155,
        1168
      ],
      "start": 614.19,
      "end": 620.43
    },
    {
      "en": "He said, \"One is to plant a tree for every man, woman, and child over the next decade.\"",
      "asr_range": [
        1168,
        1186
      ],
      "start": 620.67,
      "end": 627.47
    },
    {
      "en": "Next, we are very much focused on bringing existing woodland into management because it doesn't make any sense to plant new woodland if you can't manage what you've got already.",
      "asr_range": [
        1186,
        1216
      ],
      "start": 627.71,
      "end": 638.99
    },
    {
      "en": "Finally, we want to engage people a lot more in their natural environment, that is, in planting trees, in managing areas.",
      "asr_range": [
        1216,
        1237
      ],
      "start": 639.55,
      "end": 647.79
    },
    {
      "en": "And in understanding more about the benefits that trees and woodlands bring to our society.",
      "asr_range": [
        1237,
        1252
      ],
      "start": 648.03,
      "end": 655.23
    },
    {
